{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Scraps - Hellmouth Creek</i> is a suspense-filled scrapbooking game. Ride a bike, float down a river in an inner tube, and explore forest paths while capturing photos that become part of your scrapbook. Each photo you take grows into a record of your trip, filled with discoveries, customization, and hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/f4e6fd5375d467e80797e1a6ff16134c.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bike the country landscapes, float down a winding river in your inner tube, and run through the forest to make it back safely to your car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/091dd98df56736f8e23b486918160774.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take photos at key spots and preserve your journey with a collection of snapshots. Watch the scenery change as you progress and interact with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/1ebd519505bd575516aa7eaf39501ecc.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Arrange photos, add stickers, and design a scrapbook page that reflects your personal style! Unlock more customization options the more photos you take!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/1d1b0e39564635f938cccbdfd2ce119d.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock hidden details by experimenting with photography: so many secrets to be found and photographed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/e233ee2a5c499859ec4a82f3e5268ef2.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Complete objectives that guide your scrapbook progress and reward you with new customizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Scraps: Hellmouth Creek</i> today and be among the first to uncover its secrets when the game launches!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806810?t=1769994535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/9c3842d12457293afa104e400b73f82548cff2c7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769994535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/b1c56ac29e51877d635aa76e7c1ec6ec096a56f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769994535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/b1c56ac29e51877d635aa76e7c1ec6ec096a56f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769994535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4222810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Scraps - Hellmouth Creek</i> is a suspense-filled scrapbooking game. Ride a bike, float down a river in an inner tube, and explore forest paths while capturing photos that become part of your scrapbook. Each photo you take grows into a record of your trip, filled with discoveries, customization, and hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/f4e6fd5375d467e80797e1a6ff16134c.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bike the country landscapes, float down a winding river in your inner tube, and run through the forest to make it back safely to your car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/091dd98df56736f8e23b486918160774.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take photos at key spots and preserve your journey with a collection of snapshots. Watch the scenery change as you progress and interact with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/1ebd519505bd575516aa7eaf39501ecc.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Arrange photos, add stickers, and design a scrapbook page that reflects your personal style! Unlock more customization options the more photos you take!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/1d1b0e39564635f938cccbdfd2ce119d.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock hidden details by experimenting with photography: so many secrets to be found and photographed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/extras/e233ee2a5c499859ec4a82f3e5268ef2.avif?t=1769994535\" width=468 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Complete objectives that guide your scrapbook progress and reward you with new customizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Scraps: Hellmouth Creek</i> today and be among the first to uncover its secrets when the game launches!</strong></p>","developers":["Polias Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/b035df0ec8b3a121e120c8f6c2012e771d84f187/header.jpg?t=1769994535","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/1652361728/5e74e63bb06471e4a0e00f44daf1d57a5a78e822/1760297678/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760297967","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/1652361728/5e74e63bb06471e4a0e00f44daf1d57a5a78e822/1760297678/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760297967","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/1652361728/5e74e63bb06471e4a0e00f44daf1d57a5a78e822/1760297678/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760297967","id":257216571,"name":"Demo Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216571/9b192efcc2db25a2db75fcb00e91c4e7ba7895c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760297967"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/234653509/ff175e7e4c83efe9ff6dd01855cd61b800f259b3/1754873088/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754874623","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/234653509/ff175e7e4c83efe9ff6dd01855cd61b800f259b3/1754873088/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754874623","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806810/234653509/ff175e7e4c83efe9ff6dd01855cd61b800f259b3/1754873088/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17548